{"1725810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Myrne 6313", "steam_appid": 1725810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/b20c402c43c55fac1b786483c87771b4.poster.avif?t=1784016380\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/b20c402c43c55fac1b786483c87771b4.webm?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/b20c402c43c55fac1b786483c87771b4.mp4?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of a game mixing the extraction shooter genre and corporate life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Me neither - yet here it is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive an hostile office space where each step can be your last. Help HR find their stapler, get chased by security dogs, clear your inbox, fight occult cultists in the parking lot, loot everything that's not attached to the ground, try to pay the crippling debt you own to MEGACORP… And much more.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/dd22e0c175519fc810639bfa04ff4824.poster.avif?t=1784016380\" width=512 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/dd22e0c175519fc810639bfa04ff4824.webm?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/dd22e0c175519fc810639bfa04ff4824.mp4?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myrne 6313 is a singleplayer extraction shooter RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wander around the office and its surroudings to find loot and items you need to complete the missions you received in your inbox, but be careful: getting killed will make you lose everything you have on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too greedy and extract as much as possible before security, jealous co-workers and/or other creatures and baddies gets you. Everything in your <span class=\"bb_strike\">broom closet</span> office's locker is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Myrne 6313 is not a rogue-lite even though it's run-based, completing quests will get you better relation with factions which let you order better gear, most progress is permanent and you'll keep everything from a successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/6d82672d7cb80951e511078811456d25.avif?t=1784016380\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm just one guy, trying to create fun RPGs. I take inspirations in games like Arx Fatalis, Morrowind, Arcanum, tabletop RPGs and even boardgames (my favourites are Descent 2nd ed., Mistfall, Level 7: Omega Protocol). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I started messing around with Unity in 2014 and released a few games on Steam since. i try to pack everything in the same universe: Myrne. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I try to do everything by myself and build handcrafted games that ooze passion instead of relying on procedural generation or other forbidden occult tools like AI.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/b20c402c43c55fac1b786483c87771b4.poster.avif?t=1784016380\" width=456 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/b20c402c43c55fac1b786483c87771b4.webm?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/b20c402c43c55fac1b786483c87771b4.mp4?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever dreamed of a game mixing the extraction shooter genre and corporate life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Me neither - yet here it is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive an hostile office space where each step can be your last. Help HR find their stapler, get chased by security dogs, clear your inbox, fight occult cultists in the parking lot, loot everything that's not attached to the ground, try to pay the crippling debt you own to MEGACORP… And much more.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/dd22e0c175519fc810639bfa04ff4824.poster.avif?t=1784016380\" width=512 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/dd22e0c175519fc810639bfa04ff4824.webm?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/dd22e0c175519fc810639bfa04ff4824.mp4?t=1784016380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myrne 6313 is a singleplayer extraction shooter RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wander around the office and its surroudings to find loot and items you need to complete the missions you received in your inbox, but be careful: getting killed will make you lose everything you have on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too greedy and extract as much as possible before security, jealous co-workers and/or other creatures and baddies gets you. Everything in your <span class=\"bb_strike\">broom closet</span> office's locker is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Myrne 6313 is not a rogue-lite even though it's run-based, completing quests will get you better relation with factions which let you order better gear, most progress is permanent and you'll keep everything from a successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/extras/6d82672d7cb80951e511078811456d25.avif?t=1784016380\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm just one guy, trying to create fun RPGs. I take inspirations in games like Arx Fatalis, Morrowind, Arcanum, tabletop RPGs and even boardgames (my favourites are Descent 2nd ed., Mistfall, Level 7: Omega Protocol). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I started messing around with Unity in 2014 and released a few games on Steam since. i try to pack everything in the same universe: Myrne. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I try to do everything by myself and build handcrafted games that ooze passion instead of relying on procedural generation or other forbidden occult tools like AI.</p>", "short_description": "Myrne 6313 is a mix between the extraction shooter genre and corporate life. Survive an hostile office space where each step can be your last. Help HR find their stapler, get chased by security dogs, clear your inbox, fight cultists in the parking lot, learn magic… And more!", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/3aae12194d2e8d69b2a37d63d2f8365a24542a92/header.jpg?t=1784016380", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725810/3511023f34ada89c243ce082ea28e34bd9af1458/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784016380", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as